# Leftover backup from repo history fix — not part of this project
.git-backup-old-dataquest-project/

# Raw source data IS committed, deliberately. It was excluded at first on size
# grounds, and that was the wrong call for this project: the whole argument rests
# on evidence a judge can check, and "run our script and trust that the department
# still serves the same file" is weaker than shipping the file. The NSC PDFs matter
# most - we extracted them ourselves because no machine-readable version exists, so
# without them the extraction cannot be independently verified.
# Largest file is 26 MB, under GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.


